# Normalize every text file to LF in the repository, while leaving the working
# tree native (CRLF on Windows). The index was already LF-only, so this changes
# nothing today — it just stops a future Windows contributor from committing
# CRLF and making every line of a file show up as modified.
#
# Prettier is set to `endOfLine: "auto"` to match, so `npm run lint` does not
# flag a native CRLF checkout. Without both halves the linter reported ~14,800
# phantom `Delete ␍` errors on Windows, which buried the real findings.
* text=auto

# Generated artifacts: keep diffs collapsed in review.
package-lock.json  linguist-generated=true
openapi/openapi.json  linguist-generated=true
openapi/openapi.yaml  linguist-generated=true
